// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P2090325601" "The Rift Enclosure"
// tDetailString :
"P2923153142" "<color gold>The Rift Enclosure</color><br><br>You were recruited by Provost Marchand to go through the Rift Enclosure into Primal Earth. Two choices laid before you when you arrived. Would you go to Paragon City to try to find a peaceful solution to the war between Praetoria and Primal Earth, or would you go to the Rogue Isles to seek out your own power and glory? Whichever choice you made, you walked through the portal in the Rift Enclosure, leaving the world of Praetoria behind to enter a new world: the world of Primal Earth."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - ResistanceHero 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1051376703" "IGNORE RESISTANCE HERO PAGE FOR THE LOYALIST MISSION. I'M KEEPING THIS HERE AS A BACK UP."
// Answer Text :
"P3405175878" "Helped Robert Flores"
// Answer Text :
