// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ObjectiveUIText :
"P1088576463" "Enter Talos Island"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 5 Caption :
"P3891809161" "<t=5 x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkSlateGray>Your time in Praetoria is coming to an end..."
// 3 Caption :
"P1161882442" "<t=5 x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkSlateGray>... and now, the choice of your new life in Primal Earth lays before you."
// 7 Caption :
"P427917906" "<t=7 x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkSlateGray>You know now, that Cole intends to wipe out all supers in Primal Earth, believing it is for the safety of those in Praetoria."
// 7 Caption :
"P3881168770" "<t=7 x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>Will you go to Paragon City to try and prevent Cole's invasion? To try to ensure that no innocents in Praetoria or Primal Earth come to harm?"
// 7 Caption :
"P1931492720" "<t=7 x= 0.8 y=0.2 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>Or will you go to the Rogue Isles to seek your own power and glory, allowing Cole to do as he wishes? Or, perhaps, to rival his own power?"
// LeftText :
"P1418237083" "<scale 2.5><span align=center><color Paragon>Go to Paragon City</color></scale><br><br><color Paragon>Become a Hero</color></span><br><br>There may still be time to save the innocents of Primal Earth from Cole's invasion, if you can convince them that not all Praetorians seek to destroy their way of life. You'll have to go to Primal Earth and help the people there in any way, shape, or form in order to show them the goodness that resides within Praetoria. Perhaps then, Cole will see that an invasion doesn't have to happen, that the war effort can be used to help secure Praetoria from monsters like the Hamidon.<br><br><scale .8><color slategray><i>(As your own story unfolds on Primal Earth, you will have opportunities to switch sides.)</i></scale>"
// RightText :
"P3084771229" "<scale 2.5><span align=center><color orange>Go to the Rogue Isles</color></scale><br><br><color red>Become a Villain</color></span><br><br>Why would you want to go to <i>help</i> the people of Primal Earth when all they've shown is disdain and hatred towards Praetoria? If you go to the Rogue Isles, you can carve out your own destiny, your own path for power, for glory, for <i>whatever</i> you want. When the time comes that Cole invades, you'll either join alongside him, or fight him off using your new found power.<br><br><i><scale .8><color slategray>(As your own story unfolds on Primal Earth, you will have opportunities to switch sides.)</scale></i>"

